The '''ancient castle''' (Japanese: '''古城''' ''old castle'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Galar]] [[region]], located in '''Breezy Hills''' (Japanese: '''スズカゼ丘陵''' ''Breezy Hill'') near [[Hammerlocke]].

==History==
[[File:Old Castle ruins.png|thumb|250px|left|The ancient castle in ruins after the battle with the [[Explorers]]]]
In ''[[HZ024|Reunion at the Ancient Castle!]]'', [[Diana]]'s {{p|Squawkabilly}} led [[Liko]], [[Roy]], and [[Friede]] to the ancient castle, the entrance of which was hidden and guarded by a {{p|Stonjourner}}. It was here where Diana was living during her time in Galar and where she reunited with her granddaughter, Liko. Soon, [[Amethio]] and his teammates invaded the ancient castle after scaring off the Stonjourner. 

In ''[[HZ025|Rivals in the Dark of Night!]]'', [[Hamber]], [[Coral]], and [[Sidian]] also arrived at the ancient castle. The confrontation ended with Coral's {{p|Glalie}} using {{m|Self-Destruct}}, leaving the castle in ruins.

Prior to ''[[HZ123|Mochi Mayhem!]]'', Diana took a set of [[Auspicious Armor]] from the castle to give to [[Liko's Charcadet]].

In [[HZ132]], it was revealed that Diana fixed up the castle by billing Hamber for the damages and all of the wild Pokémon whom lived in the castle had returned.
